{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54532","headline":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 十九 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庚辛日，前忌赤云来。\n势紧迫（京本作「迎」）吾须大战，彼军得胜我军摧，守险固颠危。\n（过旬〖京本作「日」〗中却行）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54532.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54532","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}